<rml>
<head>
    <title>touch</title>
    <link type="text/rcss" href="touch.rcss"/>
</head>

<!--
    Touch controls for phones (14-10), "like the mobile RE7, a minimum". Only DRAWS and gives the boxes: the fingers
    are read by xrGame/ui_rml_touch.cpp, which takes every button's border box from here as its hit area (a little
    bigger), so moving or resizing a button in the .rcss moves what a finger hits too.

    Contract with ui_rml_touch.cpp:
        t-stick / t-knob   the floating stick: rests at its place in the .rcss, jumps under the finger that lands on
                           the left part of the screen (left/top set inline), the knob follows the finger
        t-fire             fire (held); a drag on it turns the camera too
        t-aim              aim, toggled by a tap
        t-reload           reload (a tap), held = the next ammo type
        t-crouch           crouch (a tap), held = the deep crouch
        t-use              use / pick up / talk: class "off" while there is nothing to use; its text is the data-*
                           attribute for what is in front (take, talk, search, open, drive, drag, use)
        t-weapon           a tap = the next weapon, held = the weapon wheel (a drag on it picks the sector)
        t-inv              the inventory
        t-pause            the pause menu
    Anywhere else on the right part of the screen a drag turns the camera; a tap on the minimap opens the map, a tap
    on a quick slot uses it (those boxes come from hud.rml).
-->

<body id="touch">
    <div id="t-stick"><div id="t-knob"/></div>

    <div id="t-pause" class="tbtn small">II</div>
    <div id="t-inv" class="tbtn small">ИНВ</div>

    <div id="t-use" class="tbtn mid off" data-take="ВЗЯТЬ" data-talk="ГОВОРИТЬ" data-search="ОБЫСК"
         data-open="ОТКРЫТЬ" data-drive="СЕСТЬ" data-drag="ТАЩИТЬ" data-use="ИСПОЛЬЗ.">ВЗЯТЬ</div>
    <div id="t-weapon" class="tbtn mid">ОРУЖИЕ</div>
    <div id="t-aim" class="tbtn mid">ПРИЦЕЛ</div>
    <div id="t-reload" class="tbtn mid">ПЕРЕЗАР.</div>
    <div id="t-crouch" class="tbtn mid">ПРИСЕД</div>
    <div id="t-fire" class="tbtn big">ОГОНЬ</div>
</body>
</rml>
